# A remote import's cache (docs/remote-imports-decision.md): a real `git`
# checkout, rebuildable at any time from `deps`/`deps.lock`, not something to
# commit. `deps.lock` itself IS meant to be committed, the same discipline as
# `Cargo.lock` -- only the checkout it describes is derived, disposable state.
.m31-deps/
